{"id":"perspectiva","lemma":"perspectiva","pos":"noun","rank":2728,"glosses":["perspective","prospect"],"ipa":"/peɾspeɡˈtiba/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"perspectivas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-perspectiva.wav","examples":[{"text":"Deberíamos considerar el problema desde la perspectiva de un niño.","en":"We should consider the problem from a child's perspective.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610841","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to consider"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"problem"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"child, boy"}]},{"text":"Las perspectivas no son halagüeñas.","en":"The prospects aren't very bright.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Su perspectiva única ayudó a arrojar luz sobre la situación.","en":"His unique perspective helped shed light on the situation.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"only","l":"único"},{"g":"to help","l":"ayudar"},{"g":"to"},null,null,{"g":"envelope"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"to shed light"]]},{"text":"Abordémoslo desde otra perspectiva.","en":"Let's approach this from a different angle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/513015","words":[null,{"g":"since"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},null]},{"text":"Las perspectivas de futuro de Japón son funestas.","en":"The prospects for Japan's future look dismal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635315","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"future"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"Japanese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}